#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired[quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Refresh expired authorization code flow ID or access tokens. If this property is enabled then a refresh token request will be performed if the authorization code ID or access token has expired and, if successful, the local session will be updated with the new set of tokens. Otherwise, the local session will be invalidated and the user redirected to the OpenID Provider to re-authenticate. In this case the user may not be challenged again if the OIDC provider session is still active. For this option be effective the `authentication.session-age-extension` property should also be set to a non-zero value since the refresh token is currently kept in the user session. This option is valid only when the application is of type `ApplicationType++#++WEB_APP`++}++.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_TOKEN_REFRESH_EXPIRED+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired[quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired]`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired[quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired]`"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired[quarkus.oidc.token.refresh-expired]`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Refresh expired authorization code flow ID or access tokens. If this property is enabled then a refresh token request will be performed if the authorization code ID or access token has expired and, if successful, the local session will be updated with the new set of tokens. Otherwise, the local session will be invalidated and the user redirected to the OpenID Provider to re-authenticate. In this case the user may not be challenged again if the OIDC provider session is still active. For this option be effective the `authentication.session-age-extension` property should also be set to a non-zero value since the refresh token is currently kept in the user session. This option is valid only when the application is of type `ApplicationType++#++WEB_APP`++}++."
msgstr "刷新已过期的授权码流 ID 或访问令牌。如果启用了此属性，则当授权码 ID 或访问令牌过期时，系统将执行刷新令牌请求；若请求成功，本地会话将使用新的一组令牌进行更新。 否则，本地会话将被作废，用户将被重定向至 OpenID 提供商以重新认证。在此情况下，如果 OIDC 提供商的会话仍然有效，则用户可能不会再次被要求验证身份。 要使此选项生效，还应将 ` `authentication.session-age-extension` ` 属性设置为非零值，因为刷新令牌目前保存在用户会话中。此选项仅在应用程序类型为 ` `ApplicationType#WEB_APP` ` 时有效。"

